cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the software and the paper."
title: "riverbed-psd-gig: fitting and evaluation code for the GIG riverbed particle-size distribution"
abstract: >-
  Reproduction pipeline for "A Universal Riverbed Sediment Distribution Function
  Improves Water Security Assessments": fitting of 25 candidate particle-size
  distribution functions, model selection by BIC, derivation of representative
  grain-size percentiles, and the water-security variables that follow from them.
type: software
